<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">BaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaFl</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaFilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aFilipi</para>
  <para style="mt1">BaFilipi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aFilipi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne na aBulus nɛ aTimoti, basam Anet-Isheshek aYeso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Ba jɛk iko sak na banet Adakunom ngma fɛ́ ba ka ba moon na Anet-Isheshek aYeso na aFilipi, ngma nɛ bafi iyɛrɛ bafi ikuus nɛ bashɔn bafi ikuus:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Won itek ni kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, ni ku se ni yin.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itonong ifeng aBulus <optbreak /> nɛ awon wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />In nesek ifeng sak na Adakunom in kaakyi izen fi in yiring ni yin. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Na kaakyɛ awon fi in ras nek iyin ngma, in ras awon ni iyɛ ikan <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />nek imoon ice yin ni itaas ifɛ̀ itek e me deng, neme ni kunom imɛsɛng e sak atut, <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />in rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok, ayɔng fɛ́ a mi tumung kutomong kutek ayɛt yin, da ya kashon ni iko sak igang e, ma kunom fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek aYeso bi bɛ́s wu.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />I se gyat imi ni in fok anɔng yɔk ngma yin, nek i se yin ayɛt iyɛ hom. Nek ke ni in se ni nyang ke ni in tsin tɛnɛng ni itonong atsak ifɛ̀ itek e ayi, ngma yin i te yin kufiri ni imi ayɛt itek Adakunom e. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Adakunom wu a da kyem a tak iyɛ ingash fi in bɛ́ mok iyin kusum, ti kuri ishim fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek aYeso bɛ́ ni yit.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Awon hom yet, fok ishim yin ni bang rasak, nɔng irēn yin ta aney ayɛt irèn iyɛrɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />nɔng i da kyem i di kam yin ikyɛng fi idung se gyat, nek i di nye yin kusot kucɛ́l, vit ibeseng sak kunom ibɛ́ Anet-Isheshek, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />ni i shining yin ni nggɔn kusot kutabat fi in nes na aYeso Kristi nek iratek ni itere Adakunom.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya-inyang aBulus bɛ́ ni <optbreak /> iya kashon Ifɛ̀ Itek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Ábaruneng, in shim ni rēn yin yɔkɔnɔng fok, ikyɛng fi ite ni imi, ibang bɛ́ ni iya kashon ifɛ̀ itek e. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Anɔng e mi bɛ́ na awɛshɛk na bafi itosok kari igwɔm ngma nɛ ishɛrɛp banet fok imi se ni nyang nek Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Nek inyang fi in tsin ya ide, baruneng ayɛt aTisa dot mi sɛ agap iyɛ ishara Ifɛ̀ Adakunom gbagba, vit nnyim.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />I yet atsak fok, bakak shara Ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek nek kuhwye ni ifup, awɛt bakak shara ni kuyiring kutek. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Bafɛ́ ama me shara ayɛt ishim, ba rēn fok ba di sak azeng nek itɛnɛng ifɛ̀ itek e. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Wat bafɛ́ ashon e, shara Ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek mok ishim iyɛ bà, vit atsak ayɛt e, ba di fok ba di ki tusung kudaam ni imi mo ni nyang. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Awɛt kudaam e yet akyɛ? Ikyɛng fi idung sas yet fok na kaakyɛ irèn, won na ba shara Anet-Isheshek, ke ayɛt kuyiring mbɔɔs kɛ kufɛ́ atsak ayi. Nek anɔng wu fi in di bi iyɛ ikan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:18">Ey, in da ya kashon ni iyɛ ikan, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />nek imi rēn fok, ayɛt awon yin ni igbingding fɛ́ Kabik aYeso Kristi nesek, ikyɛng fi i te ni mi da bɛ ni iwuruk hom. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />In bi iyɛ ngash ni ite iyɛ fok, in da sɔ nsum awo, tit nkum yɔkɔnɔng sak ashon in da yit iyɛ makiyi nɔng Anet-Isheshek da sɛ iratek ni kusot hom, kɛ ni in se ni kutset kɛ ni in ku ayi.<verse eid="PHP 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Wɔn imi, kutset yet ni in se ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, iku yet awɛng. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ki in da bang sot ni kutset, i da sot in da ya kashon ni kutomong kutek. Ngma na anɔng, ingan de fi in da kasa de yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Nkyɔrɔk nfa me di te nate: A di se ki in tseng in tsin sot na Anet-Isheshek, mok anɔng e wu a dung sas imi; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />awɛt nek itek yin, i se yɛɛt ni in bang se ni kutset. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Iyɛ hom mi di tonong tsɛng-tsɛng fok, in da bang sot, in da ya kashon ni iyin ngma, nɔng i da rasak yin ni bɛ yin iyɛ ikan ayɛt atsak yin, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />nɔng ayɛt kusot kufiri hom ni iyin, ifeng yin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso da bang shining dot nek imi.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Ayɛt akaakyi ikyɛng: won kusot yin ni ku tseng kpaf ni ifɛ̀ itek Anet-Isheshek. Ama anɔng, kɛ ni in kyem in bi in ki di yin kɛ ni in fok ifɛ̀ natoon yin ayi, ikyɛng fi in shim in fok yet, i mi tup yin atak gak ni se yin bazining na abik, na ra yin itsom te anet azining nek inɔɔk atsak yin ni ifɛ̀ itek e <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />bafi ifa ni iyin bi ki shirik yin awo, anɔng e da ka ba tonong fok ba da ka ba ngɔɔt. Awɛt iyin bi sɛ yin isheshek ni bɔk Adakunom ikyɛng wu. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Nek ikyɛng itek fɛ́ a ki nye yin ne yet fok ni nɔk yin atsak na Anet-Isheshek kyɛk awo, tit fok ni i sɔ yin mgbang nek iwu, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />ayet iyin yɔng i tsin bɔrɔng yin kyɔn ti fi i kin di yin, ite ni imi, fi i tsin foos yin fok in se ni de yɔkɔnɔng ana.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Mɛɛs yin imen ice <optbreak /> Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Ki i sɛs yin igbingding fi ines nek kusot kufiri yin na Anet-Isheshek, ki i sɛs yin imen iyɛ nek ishim wu, ki ibɛ yin inyis nɛ Kabik, ki ibɛ yin ishim nɛ angmishish, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />in tsin ra won ni yin, sak yin iyɛ ikan hom ni di barang dot, won kuyiring yin ni kusot kuzining, ni shim yin bafidang, sot yin bazining ayɛt abik ni ikyɛng fi i da nye yin. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />I bi nye yin ikyikak nek ishim ice kɛ nek ito ice awo, tit ayɛt nggɔn imen ice ni kok yin bafidang se kashon ni iyin. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Akak yin bi tsɛt ikyikak ifi ishim ice wu kyɛk awo, tit idɔng fɛ́ bakak di ki sɛ itek bà. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Won nggɔn yin ni in tas nfɛ́ Anet-Isheshek aYeso,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Iwu fɛ́ ngma ni kusɛ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">tɛ Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">da a sok nagbirigbɔng wu tɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">na Adakunom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">Ti ikyɛng fɛ́ a di ki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">tekap shɛng awo.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Awɛt, a sok ice wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">tɛ a yet ikyikak awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">a sok nse kusot asam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">a bɛ azatse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">ni kurɔm anet awe.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ayɛt nse wu tɛ anet awe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">a men ice wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">a nabak ice wu sak ni iku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">sak ni iku, kuri ifi itekak!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Nek anɔng, Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">ku sok garang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">sak narɔ fɛ́ ka dung wat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">A ku nɔk iyerek fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">i wat kaakyi iyerek.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Nɔng, ni iyerek aYeso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">kaakyɛ anet da te guk akuut,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">azanɛn nɛ azatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">nɛ aben na kazatse.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Nɛ kaakyɛ anet da taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ni ilem wu fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">aYeso Kristi yet aTisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">na Ada Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">di sɛs iratek.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ron yin ti mgbey ádat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Nek anɔng, bacɛk iyɛ hom, kyɔn ti fi i mi di mɛɛ yin ni ifok-ifɛ́, da ma nek in se azɔng ni iyin kyɛk awo. I wat foos yin ide yɔkɔnɔng fi da in se azɔng ni iyin awo. Ya yin kashon ni i rasak ni kutomong isheshek yin. Ni nnyim ni itiim irɔm ashon Adakunom, sak ni igang e. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Nek Adakunom wu a se ni kutomong ayɛt ayɛ yin, nek iwu fɛ́ a ki saas yin ni ras yin ikyɛng fi iwu shim. Na ki nesek yin agap iras kpaf ikyɛng itek dɔng fɛ́ a mi sak ni iyɛ wu.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Ras yin kaakyi ikyɛng vit ikɔk ke nanan ayi, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />nɔng i da sot yin vit inɛn, ni se yin halal, nnon Adakunom fɛ́ na se vit karìk, fɛ́ ba se ayɛt banet azatse kang fɛ́ ba se kangang, kuzam banet fi nhwyɛ mi wuruk ni ba, in shim ni iron yin nate ba tɛ ádat. <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Ama anɔng bà, ni iberese yin ifɛ̀ fi i nesek kutset e gak, na anɔng wu in bi di tsot kugwɔm atuk ibɛ́ Anet-Isheshek, fok da i tsi hom ni kutomong hom kin yet kufɛ́ abap awo. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Awɛt ama inabak ashosh, ki kutset hom da sot inosong-ashi igang e, nek kutomong inɔɔk atsak yin, in bi iyɛ ikan ni ifeng ni iyin ngma. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Nek anɔng, i se gyat ni bɛ yin iyɛ ikan ni ifeng ni imi bá.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">ATimoti nɛ Apaforiditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />In bi ite iyɛ na aTisa aYeso, fok ngmash ni in tom aTimoti sak ni yin, nɔng imi bin di sɛ iyɛ ikan ama fi in mi fok ikyɛng fi i se yin ayɛt e. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Da imi ti in bɛ̀ akak fɛ́ a bɛ́ kuyiring kutek naton yin ti iwu awo. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Nek ngma ishɛrɛp e tsɛsɛk ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di ki sɛ ice bá da ikyɛng fi i di ki sɛ aYeso Kristi awo. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Awɛt iyin rēn yin fok, aTimoti mi tonong ice wu fok iwu se zɛɛt, nek ti nggon na ada ka, aTimoti mi ra isam gung ni imi ayɛt kutomong ishara ifɛ̀ deng. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Nek anɔng, in bi ite iyɛ fok ngmash ni in ku tom sak ni yin, ki in sɛ irēn ikyɛng fi i da te ni imi. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />In bi nɔɔk atsak na aTisa, fok imi ice hom, ngmash ni in bɛ́.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Awɛt imi di i se gyat ni in ti in ki tom yin Apaforiditus, aruneng, afidang itomong nɛ afi ifiri hom ni itsom, fɛ́ a tɛ a yet atom yin, ayɔng fi iyin ku tun yin na a bɛ́ a di ses mo. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />A bi iyɛ ngash ku di yin, a nɔ kudaam nek iyin fok yin fok a kurɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Ey, na tsak e a kin se ni rɔk, bakat na a ku. Awɛt Adakunom fok angmishish wu, da angmishish wu kyɛk awo, ngma ni imi. Adakunom di tun kafa kawe naton kafa kawe. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Nek anɔng, a di se ki in mi ku yirik na a bun, nɔng ki i ku di yin, i da nye yin iyɛ ikan ni kudaam hom di kyɛk. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ku shan yin ni iyerek aTisa ayɛt kafa kakan. Nesek yin banet ti iwu iratek. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Nek gyet kyɛk ke a ku nek kutomong Anet-Isheshek. A nɔɔk nwaa kutset wu ayɛt igbingding hom, a ki faam yin mo kawat ikyɛng fi iyin kyem i nye yin awo.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Kusot kutabat na Adakunom <optbreak /> nek inɔɔk atsak kyɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ni igang e, ábaruneng, nye yin iyɛ ikan ayɛt aTisa! I di se mi gbang ni in woso ki jɛk yin e naton nkyɔrɔk nang awo, nek in da ki gyerep yin.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Nye yin yɛɛt na ákabu yɔ́ng, ánet anyas yɔ́ng, bayɔng fɛ́ ba di ban fok ma ba ya anet katse, a da nɛ sɛ isheshek. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Nek ayet iyit ba fi in bɛ yit izizɔ me ifɛ́ atsak ifɛ́ banet Adakunom, bayɔng fi in ya yit Adakunom ntong ayɛt Abik, fi in tsot yit kugwɔm ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, fi da ite iyɛ yit se ni nkyɔrɔk irɔm awo, <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />ki in fi in shim, imi ice min in bi nkyɔrɔk irɔm fi ki in kyem in di te yɛndɛng ni na.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Ke akak di fok a bi nkyɔrɔk ite yɛndɛng ni irɔm, imi ku wat ni ina. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Ba di ya katse ni kunom kufi nkara, nggon mben aIsrela, afi izɔrɔk aBanyami, atutup afɛ́ aYahuda; abak ikuus ntsi, in yet aFarasi, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />naton iyɛ ingash nggɔn yit, in nesek bafi ikuus aYeso izot; naton kusot tabat kufi ikuus ntsi aMusa, in se vit inɛn.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Awɛt ngma ikyɛng fi i tsang yet ibarang ni mi, i mi sok ide imi wey nek Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Ikyɛng fi i kyɛk yet, imi mi sok kaakyɛ se kaben fi in da mara ide ni iratek makiyi fi i se ayɛt irēn Anet-Isheshek aYeso aTisa hom, nek iwu fi in mi wobok kaakyɛ. In mi sok kaakyɛ sot abap, nɔng in da bin di sɛ Anet-Isheshek, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />ni in se kufiri ni wu, da ni in bɛ́ kusot kutabat kunaan fi ku nes ni ntsi awo, tit kusot kutabat yɔng fi ku nes ayɛt inɔɔk atsak na Anet-Isheshek, kusot kutabat fi ku nes na Adakunom ni irèn inesek atsak. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />In shim in rēn Anet-Isheshek ni kukyem idoro ifaben wu ni kufiri isɔ mgbang gung ni iwu, ni in sot nagbɔng ni iwu ayɛt iku wu, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />na anɔng, in te iyɛ, in bi sɛ idoro ifaben.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nye yin nyɛk sak ni igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Da fok imi mi kyem in sɛ ngma nkyɔrɔk e nang awo, ke in mi kyem in shining nyif awo, tit in se na anyɛk sak ashon nɔng in da tekap ikyɛng e dɔng fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek aYeso kin tekap akuce hom. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Ábaruneng, da imi tsin sok ice hom fok in mi tsang tekap ide awo. Awɛt ikyɛng izining de fi in ras: In nye burum ni ikyɛng fi i mi got ni in imuu-ice ni idɔng fi i se ashon, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />in nye nyɛk sak ni igang e nɔng in da bin sok izang azanɛn fɛ́ Adakunom ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso di yes nek ide.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Ngma yit fi in mi kop yit, won ni in yere yit nkyɔrɔk e anɔng. Awɛt ke bakak bɛ́ kuyiring fi ku se zɛɛt, Adakunom wu a da ki nɔɔk yin awɛshɛk naton e. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Igbat e yet fok, won ni ya yit kashon azaton ikyɛng fi in mi tsang sɛ yit.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Ábaruneng, mon yin ice ni ishɛrɛp banet fɛ́ ba tsin mɛɛs nggɔn hom, di te yin ayisi na bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin sot kpaf ni nggɔn fi in ki won yin e. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Kpaf ti fi in mi di mɛɛ ni in ki taas yin, in shim in ti in ki tak yin na na yisi, banet dot kusot ba yet kufi iraan iku itekak Anet-Isheshek ni ikum. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Igang bá yet iwey, iya ntong bà yet nafa bá, ba tsot izɔk ba se ayɛt nkyɔrɔk nsum bá. Áyɛ bá se naton nkyɔrɔk azatse kang. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Awɛt iyit yet yit nnon mben azanɛn. In bɛ́ yit iyɛ ingash kubɛ́ Anet-Isheshek yit fɛ́ a bi ne azanɛn, aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />iwu fɛ́ a bɛ kukyem, a bi sak kaakyi ikyɛng nawop wu, a bi shesheng nrɔm yit fin in se gbɛrɛk, nɔng in bin sot nfi ízɔk ti ku fuu.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng, iyin fi in di te iyɛ, fin in shim kudi yin gyet awo. Bacɛk iyɛ hom, nek ifeng ni izang fi in bi sɛ azanɛn, se ni nyeseng yin gak ni ikuus aTisa.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus gbinding bafi ikuus <optbreak /> aTisa aYeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />In tsin ra awon na aYodiya nɛ aSintiki, na ba nosong ashi, nek ba bɛ́ kufiri na aTisa. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ngɔn, afi ifiri ni imi ni tomong atsak, kabɔk, di sɛ banyining yɔng fɛ́ ba mi nye nyɛk ni i di sɛs mo ni tomong itaas ifɛ̀ itek, ngma nɛ ba Kilemen ni ishɛrɛp bafi itomong e, bayɔng fɛ́ ayerek bá se ni ifumung kutset.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Nye yin iyɛ ikan ayɛt aYeso kaakyi izen. In tsin bang ki tak yin, nye yin iyɛ ikan. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Won nggɔn yin ni in tonong banet kuhwyɛ yin. Kubɛ́ aTisa bɛ́ bakat. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ikyikak bi ki daam yin awo, tit ayɛt akaakyɛ, taas yin Adakunom awon yin, nɛ kanak yin, ni ifeng yin ayɛt awon. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Won kusot kukyang Adakunom fi ku wat kaakyi irēn, ni ku bereng áyɛ yin ni kuyiring yin ayɛt kufiri na Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ni igang e, ábaruneng, ngma ikyɛng fi i yet atsak, ngma ikyɛng fi i se gyat, ngma ikyɛng fi i se kpaf, ngma ikyɛng fi i se cɛ́l, ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim ide, ngma ikyɛng fi i kyem, ki ikyikak dung sas ke i kyem na ba tere ide ayi, yiring yin ide. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ngma ikyɛng fi i man mɛɛs yin ni mi, ke idɔng fi i man sɛ yin ni mi, ke idɔng fi i man fok yin ni mi, ke idɔng fi i man di yin ni mi ayi, te yin ide ni tomong. Na anɔng wu, Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek kusot kukyang da sot gung ni yin.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus feng bafi ikuus <optbreak /> aFilipi nek kunang bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />In bɛ̀ iyɛ ikan na aTisa makiyi nek iyin mi ti ibun yin ni ishim yin sak ni mi ni gang e. Na tsak e, i bɛ́ yin kuyiring e, awɛt i mi ni i sɛ yin kawat itonong e kyɛk awo. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Da in tsin cɛɛt anɔng fok nek in bi kudaam awo, nek imi rēn izen fi kushɛrɛk di se. Imi mi mɛɛs kusot akabɔk na akaakyi izen. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Imi rēn izen avit ni izen isɛ shɛrɛk. In mi mɛɛs irèn akabɔk na kaakyi izen, ke ni i yet izen ihwya ke izen nzong ayi, kɛ izen isɛ shɛrɛk ke izen avit ayi. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />In da kyem in nye akaakyi ikyɛng nek kukyem fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek di nesek.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ngma ne nɔng, i se gyat fi iyin di gbinding yin ayɛt ndaam fi in di se. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Ama anɔng, iyin banet aFilipi i rēn yin fok, ni nnom imɛsɛng ishara ifɛ̀ itek deng, ni izen fi in kin won aMasedoniya, vit itusung bafi ikuus bakak fɛ́ ba kin moon ice ni imi ni irèn inesek ki ishashang ayi, ma iyin kyɛk; <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />nek izen fi in kin se na aTesaloni, iwoso di toos yin ni kunang yin. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Da iyet fok in tsin tsɛsɛk kunang awo, tit in tsin tsɛt ibarang fɛ́ ba da ki jɛk yin ayɛt izang yin e. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />In mi shan ikyɛng fi in shim ni yin juut-juut; In mi sɛ ikyɛng fi in tsɛt, yɔkɔnɔng fi in mi shan kunang yin ni bɔk Apaforiditus. Kunang fi ku bi itɛrɛk iyɛ, kunang inabak ashosh kutek fɛ́ Adakunom shan ni itɛrɛk iyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Adakunom hom da ki tarang yin ngma ndaam yin ni irèn kurúm wu fi ku se dot ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="PHP 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Won iratek ni sot ifɛ́ Ada yit Adakunom, ayɛ na ayɛ. Anɔng.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashow igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Te show yin ngma banet Adakunom fɛ́ ba se ni kufiri na Anet-Isheshek aYeso. Baruneng fɛ́ ba se azeng ni imi, ki te show yin. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Ngma banet Adakunom ki te show yin, amak e, bafɛ́ asa aKaisar.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Won itek aTisa aYeso Kristi ni se ayɛt ayɛ yin. Anɔng.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>